  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Move Forward Suriname 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sunny Point is a neighborhood in Suriname without police control where children live in poor conditions. In 2017 and 2018 we launched a dance, sports and rap community projects in Suriname for teenagers from this area and other neighborhoods.The talented children in Sunny Point stole our hearts and with your donation we can go back. Summer 2023 we want to organize dance and sport activities for the children growing up in this tough area close to Paramaribo. The more we raise the more we can do.</narrative>
  </description>
